## 编译命令历史

### Step 1: 初始化
```bash
python3 $SKILL_ROOT/scripts/ohc-run.py init-build catch2 2.13.10-r0 \
  --url=https://github.com/catchorg/Catch2/archive/refs/tags/v2.13.10.tar.gz
```

### Step 2: 配置 (CMake)
```bash
cd ~/tmp/builds/catch2-2.13.10-r0.work/
mkdir build && cd build
cmake .. \
  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local \
  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
  -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF \
  -DCATCH_BUILD_TESTING=OFF \
  -DCATCH_BUILD_EXAMPLES=OFF \
  -DCATCH_INSTALL_DOCS=OFF
```

### Step 3: 编译
```bash
# header-only 库无需 make
```

### Step 4: 安装 (DESTDIR 模式)
```bash
make install DESTDIR=~/tmp/test-install-catch2-2.13.10-r0
```

### Step 5: 打包
```bash
python3 $SKILL_ROOT/scripts/ohc-run.py package catch2 2.13.10-r0
```

### Step 6: 部署验证
